    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Perfect Fusion of Puzzles and History \u2013 Embark on an Intellectual Adventure through Ancient Civilizations!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2728570/extras/1d1f593b3c191d1af0638e6cb42afe84.poster.avif?t=1747017093\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2728570/extras/1d1f593b3c191d1af0638e6cb42afe84.webm?t=1747017093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2728570/extras/1d1f593b3c191d1af0638e6cb42afe84.mp4?t=1747017093\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the magnificent worlds of the Maya, Ancient Egypt, and Ancient Greece\u2014three great civilizations that shaped human history and gave rise to remarkable cultural treasures. Through a series of brain-teasing Sudoku challenges, unlock each precious artifact and delve into the fascinating stories behind them. Experience the unique charm of history as you solve puzzles and travel through time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>131 Cleverly Designed Sudoku Challenges</strong>: From beginner-friendly to high difficulty, each puzzle is a true test of logic and intellect.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2728570/extras/0cae36b5c83fc72e5cfd70a0fe4bdc51.poster.avif?t=1747017093\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2728570/extras/0cae36b5c83fc72e5cfd70a0fe4bdc51.webm?t=1747017093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2728570/extras/0cae36b5c83fc72e5cfd70a0fe4bdc51.mp4?t=1747017093\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In-Depth Exploration of Three Great Civilizations</strong>: Unlock 27 stunning artifacts and uncover their historical and cultural significance.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2728570/extras/260267f9143bcf3796796b4058665c33.poster.avif?t=1747017093\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2728570/extras/260267f9143bcf3796796b4058665c33.webm?t=1747017093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2728570/extras/260267f9143bcf3796796b4058665c33.mp4?t=1747017093\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Definition Details</strong>: Every artifact is presented in high-quality images, faithfully showcasing its intricate craftsmanship.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2728570/extras/c482d7e680a838632b0903e2eea89975.poster.avif?t=1747017093\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2728570/extras/c482d7e680a838632b0903e2eea89975.webm?t=1747017093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2728570/extras/c482d7e680a838632b0903e2eea89975.mp4?t=1747017093\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Detailed Information Display: </strong>Artifact descriptions include rich historical background, allowing you to gain a deeper understanding of these precious relics through the game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2728570/extras/1398cc2626e39303dd2c0976235a047c.poster.avif?t=1747017093\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2728570/extras/1398cc2626e39303dd2c0976235a047c.webm?t=1747017093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2728570/extras/1398cc2626e39303dd2c0976235a047c.mp4?t=1747017093\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Highlights</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Experience</strong>: Travel through history as you solve puzzles and feel the awe-inspiring wonders of ancient civilizations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2728570/extras/7c1937a8e3dc89582c75dfc2fb3f4044.poster.avif?t=1747017093\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2728570/extras/7c1937a8e3dc89582c75dfc2fb3f4044.webm?t=1747017093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2728570/extras/7c1937a8e3dc89582c75dfc2fb3f4044.mp4?t=1747017093\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Perfect Blend of Fun and Learning</strong>: Sharpen your logical thinking while enriching your understanding of history and culture.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Joy of Collecting</strong>: Progress through the game to unlock artifacts and build your own collection of cultural treasures.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2728570/extras/73a6644f8b91ab29f4cb4a9d9f01a9b0.poster.avif?t=1747017093\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2728570/extras/73a6644f8b91ab29f4cb4a9d9f01a9b0.webm?t=1747017093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2728570/extras/73a6644f8b91ab29f4cb4a9d9f01a9b0.mp4?t=1747017093\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to take on the challenge and uncover the ancient relics hidden within Sudoku puzzles? <strong>Relic Sudoku</strong>\u2014where puzzle-solving gains deeper meaning!</p>",
